abstract: >-
  Documentation scaffold for the IRMSD framework, intended to host prototype
  verification code, benchmark and sprint-pilot workflows, documentation, and
  machine-readable outputs. This initial release explicitly distinguishes
  synthetic pipeline-check data from future human-adjudicated benchmark data
  and real-team observations.
